りと育てられた箱入り娘で、少女小説と文通が好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロマンティストで優しく、思いやり深い性格。 あるきっかけから主人公に危機を救われ、淡い想いを抱く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の父が悪事に荷担していたとは夢にも思わず、主人公の復讐に巻き込まれようとしている事にも気づいていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"96849"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df50233cb6ea66704b1c4e034c031184c20c7c0e36c833ffb142981704c70a6a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4f828c12185775311cd3f318cf6b1ce0825c22ad60c28d0e641b1660407dac8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城みつ","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:278124:96849:6469:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c45604","characterName":"明神 詩帆里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"96854","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"278124"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25181"],"vndbCharacterId":"c45604"},"originalCharacterName":"明神 詩帆里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな神社の巫女で、彼女の養父である神主は主人公の復讐相手の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずで、純粋な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人の娘に成長してからも、まるで性的なものに興味なく、無関心。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25181","sourceWorkId":"7933","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな神社の巫女。 養父である神主は彼女の亡父の弟でもあり、主人公の復讐相手の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずでおおらか、純粋培養されたような性格。 娘らしく成長してからも、いまだに性的なものには疎く無関心。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"96854"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1